cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use or reference Mapping Voices in research, teaching, or another
  project, please cite it as below. To cite a single collection, cite its
  holding institution and give the Mapping Voices identifier (e.g.
  MV-000023) as the finding aid.
title: "Mapping Voices: An Open Atlas of Oral-History and Voice-Testimony Collections"
